  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Since the circle with centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&alpha;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&beta;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;touches the circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;externally and also touches <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mtext>axis</mtext></math>,</p><p>therefore the distance between the centres will be equal to the sum of the radius of both circles</p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&alpha;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&beta;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&beta;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><msup><mi>&alpha;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&beta;</mi></math></p><p>Hence the locus of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Now, the area bounded by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&int;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>64</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
